    "legend": "Radiological features in a 16-year-old boy with <em>EWSR1</em>::<em>NFATC2</em> rearranged sarcoma of the femur. The plain radiograph shows a geographical osteolytic endomedullary lesion along the medial cortex in the distal femur diaphysis, and an associated surface component causing typical saucerization of the cortex.",
